OL,3,GNEWSANext phase of seaside promenade
OL,4,Arevamp planned
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for the next
OL,7,Fphase of a revamp of a Lincolnshire
OL,8,Fseaside promenande.
OL,10,FA recreational area would be developed
OL,11,Fin Sutton on Sea, featuring a cycle
OL,12,Fhub, a free wheelchair loan unit and a
OL,13,Fstorage workshop for voluntary groups.
OL,15,FThe proposed site is on a former
OL,16,Fbowling green and garden.
OL,18,FIt follow the first phase of the
OL,19,Fredevelopment which involved
OL,20,Fimprovements to the pleasure gardens,
OL,21,Fand the opening of the Seaview
OL,22,FColonnade cultural hub.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
